# Requests of lab 5.1 (REV-14), in the order of "Check it" in the lab booklet.
# Start first: EventServiceApp (port 8084), then your review-service.
@reviewUrl = http://localhost:8083

### Health, without login
GET {{reviewUrl}}/actuator/health

### Metrics, without login
GET {{reviewUrl}}/actuator/metrics

### Metrics as alice
GET {{reviewUrl}}/actuator/metrics
Authorization: Basic alice@example.com alice

### Counter reason:failed as olivia, before
GET {{reviewUrl}}/actuator/metrics/events.failed?tag=reason:failed
Authorization: Basic olivia@example.com olivia

### A review for event 99, with a request id
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/99/reviews
Authorization: Basic alice@example.com alice
X-Request-Id: rev14-unknown
Content-Type: application/json

{"stars": 4, "text": "Great evening."}

### Counter reason:failed as olivia, after
GET {{reviewUrl}}/actuator/metrics/events.failed?tag=reason:failed
Authorization: Basic olivia@example.com olivia

### Event service with --events.failure-rate=1.0: counter reason:failed, before
GET {{reviewUrl}}/actuator/metrics/events.failed?tag=reason:failed
Authorization: Basic olivia@example.com olivia

### Event service with --events.failure-rate=1.0: a review
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Authorization: Basic alice@example.com alice
X-Request-Id: rev14-failed
Content-Type: application/json

{"stars": 4, "text": "Great evening."}

### Event service with --events.failure-rate=1.0: counter reason:failed, after
GET {{reviewUrl}}/actuator/metrics/events.failed?tag=reason:failed
Authorization: Basic olivia@example.com olivia

### Event service stopped: counter reason:timeout, before
GET {{reviewUrl}}/actuator/metrics/events.failed?tag=reason:timeout
Authorization: Basic olivia@example.com olivia

### Event service stopped: a review
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Authorization: Basic alice@example.com alice
X-Request-Id: rev14-timeout
Content-Type: application/json

{"stars": 4, "text": "Great evening."}

### Event service stopped: counter reason:timeout, after
GET {{reviewUrl}}/actuator/metrics/events.failed?tag=reason:timeout
Authorization: Basic olivia@example.com olivia
